# Quarum — DroidScript App Rebuild Handoff

## Your task
Rewrite `Quarum.js.txt` (the DroidScript Android app source) to match a new
PC backend. The current source is included below. The new UI needs proper
buttons for AI selection, actions, sidebar controls, and file upload.
The rebuilt file must be saved as `Quarum.js.txt` inside `Quarum/Quarum.js.txt`
then rezipped as `Quarum.spk` (it is a standard ZIP archive).

---

## What the system is
A multi-AI open conversation system. The Android app is a mobile terminal that
sends prompts to a PC backend. The backend controls four AI web UIs running in
Microsoft Edge on the PC via browser automation. Each AI sees the others'
responses but never its own prior messages.

**Active AIs:** Claude · Gemini · Grok · Copilot
**Removed:** ChatGPT (banned — do not include)

---

## Backend tunnel
The PC backend is reachable at a tunnel hostname the user enters at app startup.
The app stores this as `tunnelIP` and constructs URLs as:
`http://{tunnelIP}/{endpoint}`

---

## Full backend endpoint reference

### Core
| Method | Path | Body / Params | Purpose |
|--------|------|---------------|---------|
| POST | `/send` | `{prompt, targets[], ai}` | Send prompt. `targets` is optional array of AI keys — omit to send to all. `ai` is just a label. |
| GET | `/poll` | — | Returns next queued response string (empty if none). Poll every 2s. |

### AI control
| Method | Path | Body | Purpose |
|--------|------|------|---------|
| POST | `/action` | `{ai, action}` | Click a feature/sidebar/upload button on an AI tab |
| GET | `/conversations` | `?ai=claude` | Returns `{ai, conversations:[{title,href}]}` list from sidebar |
| POST | `/switch` | `{ai, title}` | Switch to conversation by partial title match |
| POST | `/upload` | `{ai, filePath}` | Upload a local file to an AI's composer |

### Admin / system
| Method | Path | Body | Purpose |
|--------|------|------|---------|
| POST | `/command` | `{command}` | Send IRC-style command (see below) |
| GET | `/status` | — | JSON system status |
| GET | `/log` | — | Download full conversation log as JSON |
| GET | `/events` | — | SSE stream (admin panel use) |

### IRC commands (send via POST /command or type in prompt prefixed with `#/`)
```
#/kill          full system shutdown (closes Edge + server)
#/quit          alias for kill
#/mute claude   silence an AI from round-robin
#/unmute grok   re-enable a muted AI
#/reload all    refresh all AI browser tabs
#/reload gemini refresh one AI tab
#/resume        resume after kill
#/status        push status to poll queue
#/clear         clear transcript display
```

---

## Actions per AI (POST /action body examples)

### Claude
