mainLayout.AddChild(row)
```

---

## Repacking instructions
The SPK file is a ZIP archive. After editing `Quarum/Quarum.js.txt`:
```
cd D:\Quarum-src
zip -r D:\Quarum.spk Quarum/
```
Or use any ZIP tool — rename the output to `.spk`.

---

## Notes
- `Service.js.txt` in the archive is unchanged boilerplate — do not modify
- Poll interval stays at 2000ms
- Tunnel IP is stored as plain string — the hostname `f1006755973a80.lhr.live`
  or a raw IP works equally (app prepends `http://`)
- IRC commands can also be typed directly into the prompt input (start with `#/`)
